<header><p class="enc-kicker">People / group</p><h1 class="enc-title">Elamites</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Elamites were the people of ancient <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/elam">Elam</a> in south-western <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/iran">Iran</a>, who formed the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/elamite-confederation">Elamite Confederation</a>. They were long-term rivals and neighbours of Mesopotamian states, contributing to the fall of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/neo-sumerian-empire">Neo-Sumerian Empire</a> and fighting the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/assyrian-empire">Assyrian Empire</a>.</p></div>
